First allowed at Level 2.  
Conditions at Level 2:  
- NO twisting or turning allowed after back handspring step out;  
- NO jump skills connected to handspring;  
- NO twisting while airborne except round offs.

TUMBLING — B. STANDING
LEVEL 2: Single handspring  
NO twisting or turning allowed after back handspring step out;  
NO jump skills connected to handspring;  
NO twisting while airborne except round offs  

TUMBLING — C. RUNNING  
LEVEL 2: Handspring series  
NO twisting or turning allowed after back handspring step out;  
NO twisting while airborne except round offs

- Waist level single leg; 
- Prep level two leg (may immediately pass through an extended position); 
- Prep level single leg with additional base with hand/arm connection to top person prior to initiation of single leg stunt; 
- Walk up shoulder stands. 
- NO single based stunts with multiple top persons.
